  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I've noticed that, at least with my rig, lock head works well when looking up (because I can't see the hip drift), and lock both works well when looking down (because there aren't extreme spine-folding artifacts). I wonder if it would be possible to have a hybrid mode that transitions between the two smoothly?\nHere's a video I made showing some of these behaviors. I realize now that my sleeves make it hard to see, I might re-record later: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kILhX7VxFe8",
